      "message": "not everything in BluetoothDevice is an API.\nIt;s only if it is:\npublic and not @hide\npublic and @hide but annotated with @systemAPI\n\nSo this is not an API: \n```\n    /**\n     * The metadata of the audio spatial data. Data type should be {@link Byte} array.\n     *\n     * @hide\n     */\n    public static final int METADATA_SPATIAL_AUDIO \u003d 24;\n```\n\nthis is a systemApi\n```\n    /**\n     * The metadata of the Fast Pair for LE Audio capable devices. Data type should be {@link Byte}\n     * array.\n     *\n     * @hide\n     */\n    @SystemApi public static final int METADATA_LE_AUDIO \u003d 26;\n```\nand this is a public API\n```\n    /** Bluetooth device type, Unknown */\n    public static final int DEVICE_TYPE_UNKNOWN \u003d 0;\n```\n\n\n\n-----\n\n\nBut this comment become obsolet if we do the proper API as suggested in the other comment",
